.TH DPIAWAREMOUSE 1 "November 2026" "dpiawaremouse 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
dpiawaremouse \- DPI-aware mouse crossing tool
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B dpiawaremouse
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B dpiawaremouse
makes the mouse pointer cross between monitors with different DPI
scaling factors in a consistent way, so that the pointer leaves one
screen and enters the next at the matching physical position instead
of jumping.
.PP
This is an early development version that currently only prints the
program version.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success.
